Error [E0112]: `edit` cannot be used as a function value
  --> tests/ui/function_value_access_cannot_erase.jet:10:22
    |
 10 |     edit_callback :: edit
    |                      ^^^^
 Why: parameter 1 requires the write-capability marker `&`, but `fn(T)` function values take every parameter with plain read access
 Fix: call this function directly; function values cannot erase write or ownership requirements

Error [E0112]: `consume` cannot be used as a function value
  --> tests/ui/function_value_access_cannot_erase.jet:11:25
    |
 11 |     consume_callback :: consume
    |                         ^^^^^^^
 Why: parameter 1 requires the move-capability marker `^`, but `fn(T)` function values take every parameter with plain read access
 Fix: call this function directly; function values cannot erase write or ownership requirements
